WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.380
Sočna i kremasta tortilja pita iz rerne

2
00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.000
je mom mužu i deci bukvalno postala novi favorit.

3
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.300
Sve što vam treba je malo parizera ili šunke, jogurt i so.

4
00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:10.100
Ali prava tajna je u sirevima.

5
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.780
Koristim Podgorac sireve

6
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.520
jer daju neverovatan šmek.

7
00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.720
Kačkavalj se savršeno rasteže,

8
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.420
ali onaj dimljeni sir, ljudi, to je next level.

9
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.140
Slažete tortilju, fil,

10
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:21.700
pa narendate sir, i tako u krug.

11
00:00:21.780 --> 00:00:23.720
Moj muž i dečaci ovo obožavaju,

12
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:24.960
i gotovo je dok trepneš.

13
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.720
U rernu na 180 stepeni 20 minuta,

14
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:28.640
i pogledajte ovo.

15
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.780
Kačkavalj se topi, kora je hrskava,

16
00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.540
a unutrašnjost previše kremasta.

17
00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:34.460
Javite kad isprobate, i prijatno vam!
